    - language: 0
      text: Gain {{SHIELD}} Shield.
    - language: 1
      text: "Nh\u1EADn {{SHIELD}} Khi\xEAn."
  - id: card_0003_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Gain {{SHIELD}} Shield. Gain 2 Thorns.
    - language: 1
      text: "Nh\u1EADn {{SHIELD}} Khi\xEAn. Nh\u1EADn 2 Gai."
  - id: card_0004_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Exhaust. Gain 2 Fortify.
    - language: 1
      text: "Ti\xEAu hao. Nh\u1EADn 2 Ki\xEAn C\u1ED1."
  - id: card_0005_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Gain 3 Regeneration.
    - language: 1
      text: "Nh\u1EADn 3 H\u1ED3i M\xE1u."
  - id: card_0006_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Heal 10% Max HP.
    - language: 1
      text: "H\u1ED3i 10% HP T\u1ED1i \u0111a."
  - id: card_0007_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Deal {{DMG}} damage. Deals +50% damage if you have Thorns.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng. G\xE2y th\xEAm
        50% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng n\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n c\xF3 Gai."
  - id: card_0008_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Exhaust. Remove all Debuffs from self.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. Ti\xEAu hao. Lo\u1EA1i b\u1ECF to\xE0n b\u1ED9 Hi\u1EC7u
        \u1EE9ng x\u1EA5u kh\u1ECFi b\u1EA3n th\xE2n."
  - id: card_0009_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Deal {{DMG}} damage.
    - language: 1
      text: "G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - id: card_0010_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Deal {{DMG}} damage.
    - language: 1
      text: "G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - id: card_0011_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Gain {{SHIELD}} Shield. Gain 1 Barrier.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. Nh\u1EADn {{SHIELD}} Khi\xEAn. Nh\u1EADn 1 R\xE0o Ch\u1EAFn."
  - id: card_0012_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Deal {{DMG}} damage. Deals +50% damage if you have Thorns. Apply
        1 Vulnerable to enemy.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng. G\xE2y th\xEAm
        50% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng n\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n c\xF3 Gai. \xC1p d\u1EE5ng
        1 D\u1EC5 T\u1ED5n Th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch."
  - id: card_0013_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Exhaust. Heal 20% Max HP. Gain 2 Regeneration,1 Fortify,1 Persistent.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. Ti\xEAu hao. H\u1ED3i 20% HP T\u1ED1i \u0111a. Nh\u1EADn
        2 T\xE1i Sinh, 1 Ki\xEAn C\u1ED1, 1 B\u1EC1n B\u1EC9."
  - id: card_0014_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Deal {{DMG}} damage.
    - language: 1
      text: "G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - id: card_0015_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Deal {{DMG}} damage.
    - language: 1
      text: "G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - id: card_0016_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Deal {{DMG}} damage.
    - language: 1
      text: "G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - id: card_0017_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Deal {{DMG}} damage. Gain 1 Stun.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng. Nh\u1EADn 1 Cho\xE1ng."
  - id: card_0018_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Deal {{DMG}} damage. Gain 1 Vulnerable.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng. Nh\u1EADn 1 D\u1EC5
        T\u1ED5n Th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - id: card_0019_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Deal {{DMG}} damage. Deals 2x damage if target has Vulnerable.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng. Nh\xE2n \u0111\xF4i
        (x2) s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng n\u1EBFu m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu b\u1ECB D\u1EC5 T\u1ED5n
        Th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - id: card_0020_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Deal {{DMG}} damage. Apply 2 Vulnerable to enemy.
    - language: 1
      text: "G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng. \xC1p d\u1EE5ng 2 D\u1EC5 T\u1ED5n
        Th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch."
  - id: card_0021_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Exhaust. Lose 10% Current HP. Gain Berserk and recover 60 Stamina.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. Ti\xEAu hao. M\u1EA5t 10% HP Hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i. Nh\u1EADn
        Cu\u1ED3ng N\u1ED9 v\xE0 h\u1ED3i 60 Th\u1EC3 l\u1EF1c."
  - id: card_0022_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Exhaust. Gain 1 Damage Up. Apply 1 Weak to enemy.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. Ti\xEAu hao. Nh\u1EADn 1 T\u0103ng S\xE1t Th\u01B0\u01A1ng.
        \xC1p d\u1EE5ng 1 Suy Y\u1EBFu l\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch."
  - id: card_0023_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Deal {{DMG}} damage. Guaranteed critical hit if you have Berserk.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng. Ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn
        b\u1EA1o k\xEDch (critical hit) n\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n c\xF3 Cu\u1ED3ng N\u1ED9."
  - id: card_0024_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Unique. Deal {{DMG}} damage. Only usable if HP < 25%.
    - language: 1
      text: "Duy nh\u1EA5t. G\xE2y {{DMG}} s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng. Ch\u1EC9 c\xF3
        th\u1EC3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng n\u1EBFu HP < 25%."
  - id: card_0025_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Apply 2 Weak to enemy.
    - language: 1
      text: "\xC1p d\u1EE5ng 2 Suy Y\u1EBFu l\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch."
  - id: card_0026_desc
    textList:
    - language: 0
      text: Exhaust. Gain 1 Strength. Gain 1 Doom
    - language: 1
      text: "Ti\xEAu hao. Nh\u1EADn 1 S\u1EE9c M\u1EA1nh. Nh\u1EADn 1 Di\u1EC7t Vong."
  - id: card_0027_desc
